{% if dom_actor.loaded and ((actor_having_sex and render_mode == "dialogue_target") or show_internal) %}
   {% for area, value in dom_actor.training_sex -%}
      {% if value < 25 %} 
        - {{dom_actor.name}} is terrible at {{area}} sex. 
      {% else if value < 50 %} 
        - {{dom_actor.name}} has mastered the basics of giving pleasure to others and themselves with {{area}} sex.
      {% else if value < 75 %} 
        - {{dom_actor.name}} is good at giving pleasure to others and themselves with {{area}} sex.
      {% else if value < 95 %} 
        - {{dom_actor.name}} is very good at giving pleasure to others and themselves with {{area}} sex.
      {% else %} 
        - {{dom_actor.name}} has mastered {{area}} sex, able to gift to others and find for themselves the greatest of {{area}} sex pleasures. 
      {% endif %}
   {% endfor %}
{% endif %}